# WolkaraForever layer patch 0026 - Metal: identify the frame limiter
#
# Why: presentation rate and GPU execution time do not identify CPU submission
# stalls or client-side command-buffer waits. During --measure-native only,
# record the CPU interval from nextDrawable return to the presenting command
# buffer's commit, plus waitUntilCompleted and waitUntilScheduled counts. This
# makes the CPU-bound versus serialised-pipeline question falsifiable without
# sampling guest memory or altering rendering.
#
# Applies to: translation/Metal/Presentation.m
# Upstream: candidate.
#
